  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intiative for Stabilisation, Transition &amp; National Development (I-STAND)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will aim at contributing towards a more inclusive post-conflict society and stability in Somalia. It seeks to increase trust between the Somali government and its citizens, provide immediate and visible stabilisation projects in areas newly recovered from Al-shabab and provide longer-term development projects throughout the country. These political stabilization measures additionally aim at assisting the government gain legitimacy in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
